A||N||11||Four-Banger||A Fiero is not a toy...||||11||
Z||000000||Four-Banger||06-22-2001||05:23 AM||||While trying to maneuver my 84 Coupe so I could more easily work on it, our two family dogs managed, as they always do, to get in the way.  I figured that my options were to either get out of the car and tell them to move, or to honk the horn at them.  I chose the second option, only to discover that when I honked the horn, our 140 pound malamute's ears shot up, she cocked her head to the side, and came running towards the source of the sound--the same thing she does when she hears a squeaky toy.  This is the laziest dog you've ever seen, but if you break out anything that squeaks, she hauls a$$ like it's her last meal.  Bottom line...the dog thinks my Fiero is a toy.  One big squeak toy.||||reg||11
